      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "👋 Welcome to NotionHealth AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "icon": "🧠",
      "color": "blue_background",
      "content": "**NEW in v2.0!** Now powered by Meta's **TRIBEv2** brain prediction model. Get personalized recommendations based on how your brain responds to different wellness activities!"
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "📊 Quick Health Log"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Use the form below to quickly log your daily health metrics. All entries are saved to the Health Metrics database."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "📈 Today's Overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "View your latest health metrics and trends at a glance."
    },
    {
      "type": "database_view",
      "database": "health_metrics",
      "view_name": "Latest Entry",
      "view_type": "list",
      "filter": {
        "property": "Date",
        "date": "today"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "🧠 TRIBEv2 Brain Predictions"
    },
    {
      "type": "toggle",
      "title": "🎯 Predict Brain Response",
      "content": "Learn how your brain responds to different activities:\n\n**Supported Activities:**\n- 🏃 Exercise - Motor cortex, hippocampus activation\n- 🧘 Meditation - Prefrontal cortex training, amygdala calming\n- 😴 Sleep - Memory consolidation, glymphatic clearance\n- 📚 Reading - Cognitive reserve, language processing\n- 🎵 Music - Auditory cortex, emotional processing\n- 👥 Social - Oxytocin release, temporal lobe activation\n- 🌿 Nature - Visual cortex restoration, stress reduction\n- 🎨 Creative - Default mode network, problem-solving\n\nUse the Brain Predictions database to log and track predictions!"
    },
    {
      "type": "toggle",
      "title": "⏰ Optimal Activity Timing",
      "content": "**Best Times for Different Activities:**\n\n| Time | Recommended Activity |\n|------|---------------------|\n| 6:00-6:30 AM | Morning Meditation |\n| 6:30-7:30 AM | Exercise (peak cortisol) |\n| 9:00 AM-12:00 PM | Deep Work/Learning |\n| 2:00-4:00 PM | Creative Work |\n| 4:00-6:00 PM | Social Activities |\n| 8:30-9:00 PM | Evening Wind-Down |\n| 10:00 PM-6:00 AM | Sleep (8 hours) |"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "💊 Medication Tracker"
    },
    {
      "type": "database_view",
      "database": "medications",
      "view_name": "Today's Schedule",
      "view_type": "list",
      "filter": {
        "property": "Active",
        "checkbox": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "📅 Upcoming Appointments"
    },
    {
      "type": "database_view",
      "database": "appointments",
      "view_name": "Upcoming",
      "view_type": "list",
      "filter": {
        "property": "Date",
        "date": "next_30_days"
      },
      "sort": {
        "property": "Date",
        "direction": "ascending"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "🎯 Health Goals"
    },
    {
      "type": "database_view",
      "database": "goals",
      "view_name": "Active Goals",
      "view_type": "gallery",
      "filter": {
        "or": [
          {"property": "Status", "select": "in_progress"},
          {"property": "Status", "select": "on_track"}
        ]
      },
      "sort": {
        "property": "Target Date",
        "direction": "ascending"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "📝 Symptom Log"
    },
    {
      "type": "database_view",
      "database": "symptoms",
      "view_name": "Recent Symptoms",
      "view_type": "table",
      "sort": {
        "property": "Date",
        "direction": "descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
